    "New figurine recipes: Black Division and Wedge": "Nové recepty figúrok: Black Division a Wedge",
    "The Black Division Operator figurine returns a Siege-R plate carrier in 66 mins. Know the Wedge reward or the Team Leader timer and reward? Post it in our Discord.": "Figúrka Black Division Operator vracia plátový nosič Siege-R za 66 minút. Poznáte odmenu za Wedge alebo časovač a odmenu za Team Leader? Napíšte to na náš Discord.",
    "New rituals found: the Black Division Operator figurine returns a First Spear Siege-R plate carrier in 66 mins. The Wedge figurine reward and the Black Division Team Leader timer and reward are still unknown. If you know them, post in our {discord}. {view}": "Nájdené nové rituály: figúrka Black Division Operator vracia plátový nosič First Spear Siege-R za 66 minút. Odmena za figúrku Wedge a časovač aj odmena za Black Division Team Leader sú stále neznáme. Ak ich poznáte, napíšte to na náš {discord}. {view}",
